text:
Harper Lin: Heads-up 1 running a targeted microexperiment for the new Prompt Templates launch. Two arms: "Instant 120 credits" vs "RSVP-claim 30 credits". Goal: isolate template adoption behavior and downstream token velocity over 7 days. Need landing, email, 3 social posts, simple 8-min demo, routing tag, and two onboarding nudges.

Noah Kim: Solid. Suggest sample 600-900 per arm. Primary metrics: signup->first_template_use (7d), median tokens/day, % repeat-template usage. Also capture template_category.

Sasha Ivanov: I'll own creative and webinar ops. Proposed short webinar title: "Templates in Minutes: Real Prompts, Real Results". Keep demo to 8 min + one customer clip. Social cadence: teaser (48h), how-to snippet (24h), CTA (launch morning).

Ravi Mehta: Routing + CRM: append ?exp=templ_instant120 or templ_rsvp30 to signup links. Push cohort tag to CRM as lead.custom.experimental_cohort. If company_size>50 or role=PM/Eng, route to AE queue for the RSVP arm. Pseudo: 

```
const cohort = req.query.exp || 'templ_instant120';
crm.setLeadField(userId, 'experimental_cohort', cohort);
if (cohort === 'templ_rsvp30' && user.company_size > 50) {
  routeTo('ae_queue', {priority: 'high'});
} else {
  routeTo('growth_inbound', {priority: 'normal'});
}
```

EventBot: Experiment registered: id=exp_templates_credit_split_202405. Dashboard stub: https://growth.internal/exp/exp_templates_credit_split_202405. Budget guard: 180k tokens/arm. Alerts enabled.

Harper Lin: Onboarding nudges: Narrow A/B here: A) Minimal CTA: "Try a Prompt Template 1 min to see results. [Open templates]" B) Motivational guided: "Pick a use-case, apply a template, and send in 3 steps 1 Start guide". We'll measure click->apply and apply->complete.

Noah Kim: Analytics wiring: event names: template_viewed, template_applied, credits_redeemed, demo_played. I'll add template_category and first_use_delay (secs) to event payload. Daily snapshots day1/day3/day7. Funnel viz for quick checks.

Sasha Ivanov: Email subject candidates: 1) "Try Prompt Templates 120 starter credits" 2) "RSVP + claim 30 credits for our live demo". I'll prepare 3 preheaders and upload mocks to drive: https://docs.redwood/team/marketing/templates-credit-split (comments on).

Ravi Mehta: I'll deploy routing to staging today and add unit tests for CRM tag and AE surfacing. Also adding small note in lead view to show credits amount so reps can mention it.

Harper Lin: Timeline: staging routing & creative by Thu EOD, dashboard skeleton + events by Thu EOD. Launch Monday 2024-05-20 for 9 days. Reports: daily cohort counts + snapshots day3/day7 + a post-mortem.

Noah Kim: One more idea 1 add a tiny secondary test for the RSVP-claim copy: immediacy framing vs reciprocity framing. Immediacy: "Claim 30 credits now after RSVP" vs reciprocity: "Reserve your seat, we'll hold 30 credits for you". Could be nested but keep power in mind.

Sasha Ivanov: Good call. I'll add copy variants into the email + landing drafts.

EventBot: Note: experiment tags will be visible in daily export and CRM sync scheduled every 2 hours.

Harper Lin: Perfect. Owners: Sasha (creative + webinar ops), Noah (metrics + dashboard), Ravi (routing + CRM), Harper (comms + post-mortem). Please drop links and mocks here when ready and we'll review numbers in Fri 9am sync. :rocket:
